on fig","ingredient/common-fig"],["Dried fruit","ingredient/dried-fruit"],["Pear","ingredient/pear"],["Raisin","ingredient/raisin"],["Walnut","ingredient/walnut"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Helvetic Kitchen","ref":"site/helvetickitchen-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"helvetickitchen.com","note":"Andie Pilot's blog of Swiss home cooking and baking, with notes on Swiss cookbooks.","url":"https://www.helvetickitchen.com/recipes/retrospective","suggested":true},{"name":"Cuisine Helvetica","ref":"site/cuisinehelvetica-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"cuisinehelvetica.com","note":"Heddi Nieuwsma's Swiss recipes and food culture from her life in Switzerland.","url":"https://cuisinehelvetica.com/swiss-recipes","suggested":true}]},{"h":"More from Swiss cuisine","links":[["Älplermagronen","dish/alplermagronen"],["Basler Läckerli","dish/basler-lackerli"],["Bündnerfleisch","dish/bundnerfleisch"],["Cabbage roll","dish/cabbage-roll"],["Carac (pastry)","dish/carac-pastry"],["Cervelat","dish/cervelat"],["Cholera (food)","dish/cholera-food"],["Egg puffs and soup pearls","dish/egg-puffs-and-soup-pearls"],["Landjäger","dish/landjager"],["Leberkäse","dish/leberkase"],["Raclette","dish/raclette"],["Riz Casimir","dish/riz-casimir"],["Schenkele","dish/schenkele"],["Spätzle","dish/spatzle"],["Swiss sausages and cured meats","dish/swiss-sausages-and-cured-meats"],["Wähe","dish/wahe"],["Zopf","dish/zopf"],["Zuger Kirschtorte","dish/zuger-kirschtorte"],["Zürcher Geschnetzeltes","dish/zurcher-geschnetzeltes"]]}]},"dish/bubur-kacang-hijau":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/bubur-kacang-hijau","n":"Bubur kacang hijau","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from Indonesian cuisine","dot":"#f0b340","intro":[["Bubur kacang hijau, abbreviated burjo, is a Southeast Asian sweet porridge (bubur) made from mung beans (kacang hijau), coconut milk, and palm sugar or cane sugar. The beans are boiled till soft, and sugar and coconut milk are added."]],"src":"wikipedia","